# The repository root is only ever a build context for the help pages' files
# (#674): `--build-context docs=..` for the API image (api/Dockerfile), which takes
# docs/, README.md and CONTRIBUTING.md. Everything else stays out: the images are
# built from api/, web/ and reverse-proxy/, each with its own .dockerignore.
*
!docs/
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
